│   ## [Unreleased]                                                            │
│                                                                              │
│   ### Added                                                                  │
│   - Added Pricing Engine VN documentation entry covering the migration of    │
│   SkyHotel pricing logic from application-layer JavaScript/TypeScript into   │
│   a Rust core for Tauri 2.                                                   │
│   - Added business-flow documentation for the VN pricing pipeline,           │
│   including input normalization, occupancy-based pricing, surcharge          │
│   application, discount sequencing, and final total aggregation.             │
│   - Added implementation notes describing the backend boundary between       │
│   React 19 UI state and Rust pricing commands exposed through Tauri 2.       │
│   - Added traceability note referencing                                      │
│   `openspec/changes/01-pricing-engine-vn/design.md` as the primary design    │
│   source for the pricing-engine migration.                                   │
│                                                                              │
│   ### Changed                                                                │
│   - Updated project documentation to reflect that pricing calculation        │
│   responsibility is being centralized in Rust for deterministic execution,   │
│   easier testing, and parity across flows.                                   │
│   - Clarified that frontend screens should consume computed pricing          │
│   results from the Rust engine instead of duplicating pricing formulas in    │
│   React.                                                                     │
│                                                                              │
